Configuration Hierarchy

Advanced Custom Properties

tCustomPropertyScheme
Scheme
A collection of Custom Properties that can be applied to one or more Entities.
tCustomPropertyGroup
Group
A simple grouping mechanism for organizing large numbers of Custom Properties within a Scheme.
tCustomProperty
Property
A single attribute definition that can hold entity specific values.
Example
A collection of properties applied to a System called Packaging Line.
Example
Properties separates into two groups, Front of Line and End of Line.
Property
End of Line properties Packaging Mode, Allow Dual Packing, and Require Labeling. 
